extends layout/page

block body
  main
    h1 × Identity
    p.intro
      strong We are a pragmatic engineering collective.&#32;
      | We are not a bloated agency, and we don't do endless maintenance contracts. We are an invite-only network of independent senior software engineers operating under a single banner to develop state-of-the-art software solutions.&#32;
      strong When a project requires deep architectural knowledge, high-performance execution, or a rescue from technical debt, we assemble the right skills and get it done!
    hr
    h2 Philosophy
    p
      strong We make things&#32;
        s &nbsp;for the web&nbsp;
        | &#32; that don't exist but should, and we tear down things that do exist to make them better.&#32;
      | Our work is characterized by engineering at a low level, adhering to three unyielding pillars:

    section.flex-row#simple
      img(src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/4394/4394612.png" alt="simple")
      h3 Simple
      p Simplicity means eliminating unnecessary complexity. By leveraging the most direct and effective tools available, we keep the architecture lean—whether we are rapidly prototyping an MVP or designing a highly concurrent enterprise system.
      div
        h4 Simple is distinct from easy
        ul
          li Easy is stacking heavy abstractions, bloated frameworks, and unnecessary dependencies to solve a problem you don't fully understand.
          li Simple is mastering the underlying technologies to solve that same problem with absolute clarity and minimal overhead.

    section.flex-row#durable
      img(src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5414/5414529.png" alt="durable")
      h3 Durable
      p Durable means constructing properly out of high-quality components using skilled labor. Our components are rock-solid architectural patterns (like DDD and ES) and battle-tested tech stacks. Our skilled labor is rigorous Test-Driven Development, extreme programming constraints, and clean design boundaries. We work <strong>with</strong> the platform, never over it.

    section.flex-row#reliable
      img(src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/6833/6833296.png" alt="reliable")
      h3 Reliable
      p Reliability is high-quality performance over a long, continuous horizon of time. It is not a feature you bolt on at the end, nor is it achieved by adding heavy monitoring wrappers to a fragile codebase. Reliability is the natural, inevitable outcome achieved when you combine the&#32;
        strong Simple&#32;
        | with the&#32;
        strong Durable.
    hr
    h2 Evolution & Change
    p Technology constantly shifts, but we don't chase the hype.&#32;
      strong To us, true innovation is just execution with better tools.&#32;
      | We embrace new paradigms not because they are trending, but because they offer a leaner, faster, or more capable way to solve an actual problem.&#32;

    section.flex-row
      img(src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/7824/7824940.png")
      h3 Downtime
      p We spend our downtime experimenting and contributing to open-source software so our clients never have to pay for our learning curve. By the time a bleeding-edge technology shifts from experimental to practical, we already know its limits, its trade-offs, and exactly how to wield it in production without compromising stability.

    hr
    h4 Want to build with us?
    p Let's get in touch...
    a.cta(href="mailto:hey@codin.gg") hey@codin.gg
